      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, they wouldn\u0027t, until this option is set to `true` again. I see your point.\nMaybe, instead of `index.notifyListeners`, we need that option on a more narrow scope like `onlineReindexer.notifyListeners` which would switch off listener notification only from indexing operations triggered from the online reindexer but would still notify listeners for other (interactive) indexing operations.\n\nHaving said that, is there actually ever a case where we want online reindexer to notify listeners? Maybe we don\u0027t need a new option but simply skip listeners in that case?",
